before:
Complete local C# example; the app does not execute it:
```csharp
using System;
var tracker = new Tracker();
Action handler = () => Console.WriteLine("Saved");
tracker.Done += handler;
tracker.Finish();
tracker.Done -= handler;
tracker.Finish();
public class Tracker
{
    public event Action? Done;
    public void Finish() => Done?.Invoke();
}
```

